Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

1490c m-a-p's own first, then each merge by name, BF16 before its quants. 1491 the tree's players draw the whole wave, 38 px. 1492/1494 every section named at the wave's top, a row down where names meet, «anew» at the foot. 1493 Tektur headings -1 pt, Noto Sans rooms, Raleway marks +1 pt, Jura buttons +2 pt by default; the sizes applied at load (lost on reload since 1437); 1493b the bar one row at 1100 px, Create ABC Score and Generate one size, the find bar's buttons the field's height, Free tempo the lyrics' toggles' size, the note beside Generate within its row. 1494 a merge's adapters and strengths in Compute's list and the selectors' tips (/lab/models/merges); a skipped LoRA's strengths and wave disabled; the rows part under a dragged one. Kitchen suite 862/862.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
